            "review_title": "Review at Cinnamon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tegan P\n19 contributions\n0\nGreat breakfast\nNov 2016 • Family\nWe stayed at the hotel and had daily breakfast. I'm note sure about the other reviews as I highly suspect some false ones from other competitive businesses. The selection was huge and all the food was fresh and tasty. They had a chef that will make eggs any way you want them, as well as lots of bread and pastry selections, fruits and juices. The breakfast was definitely great value and I highly recommend it.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 1, 2016\nClimber659568\nDear Tegan,\n\nThank you very much for your review! We are glad you enjoyed our breakfast buffet and we hope to welcome you back soon.\n\nCinnamon Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
