            "review_title": "Review at Cinnamon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kim P\nBrisbane, Australia126 contributions\n0\nGood selection buffet breakfast\nNov 2016 • Family\nOur breakfast was included in the hotel fee and we thought that the selection provided was pretty good. We enjoyed the range of hot food and the pastries were excellent. We appreciated the ease of just going down to the dining area for breakfast. The staff were very friendly and efficient.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 25, 2016\nClimber659568\nDear TKP1325,\n\nThank you for reviewing Cinnamon Restaurant.We are very glad you enjoyed our buffet breakfast and hope to welcome you back soon. We will share your feedback with the team, to let them know they provided you with a pleasant experience.\n\nCinnamon Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten November 27, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
