            "review_text": "troycav\nRutherford, Australia171 contributions\n0\nAverage Breakfast\nOct 2016 • Family\nnow no one should complain about a free breakfast should they. so lets just so its average and leave it at that. service was good though. now my kids ate eggs at every place we stayed but even they wouldn't eat the eggs here. Fruit selection was limited. review is only based on breakfast and cant speak to lunch or dinner\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 27, 2016\nClimber659568\nDear Troycav,\nWe apologize that the quality of our breakfast buffet did not meet your standards.\nThank you very much for your review, as it will help us improve and provide better products and service in the future. Should you decide to visit Nha Trang again, we would be very happy to welcome you and show you improvements, based on your valuable feedback.\n\nCinnamon Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten October 30, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
